      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "5턴 동안 햇살을 강하게 해서\n불꽃타입 기술의 위력을 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fait briller le soleil pendant cinq tours, augmentant\nla puissance des capacités de type Feu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die Sonne brennt unbarmherzig 5 Runden\nlang. Dadurch werden Attacken vom\nTyp Feuer verstärkt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quien lo usa cava en el primer turno y ataca en\nel segundo. También se puede usar para escapar\nde lugares cerrados.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa intensifica i raggi solari per cinque\nturni, potenziando le mosse di tipo Fuoco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user intensifies the sun\nfor five turns, powering up\nFire-type moves.",
